{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8e4d6006945d280ab4b","chatId":"f0d4739fc2314d43a0c62258c9d35553","sessionId":null,"userId":69278,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":936,"promptTokens":1488,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:44"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0046082781137322115,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e4d6006945d280ab4a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369764701,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8e4d6006945d280ab4a","chatId":"f0d4739fc2314d43a0c62258c9d35553","sessionId":null,"userId":69278,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n乔最大的爱好是拍鸟的照片。几个月来，他一直试图找到一种稀有的鸟，叫做蓝鸟。在多次尝试之后，他终于发现一只蓝鸟停在一棵树枝上，感到非常高兴。于是，他坐下来准备拍照，但就在他想拍照的时候，那只鸟飞走了。当乔站在那里盯着空树枝时，那只鸟又飞了回来。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，乔最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 惊喜\nB) 失望\nC) 生气\nD) 悲观\nE) 悔恨\nF) 期待\n\n## 问题 2\n乔为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他最终可以拍下他一直寻找的鸟的照片了\nB) 乔有一台新相机\nC) 他只喜欢坐在外面\nD) 他喜欢坐在树枝上。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0046082781137322115,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e4d6006945d280ab4b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369764698,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"d83e30d1c82941d3a4d9c9460516b5f8"}